{"result":"ok","response":"collection","data":[{"id":"6a00ff92-6f15-4f2b-afb8-df1ff0bfbdb4","type":"manga","attributes":{"title":{"ko-ro":"Sesange Nappeun Yeongaeneun Eopda"},"altTitles":[{"ko":"세상에 나쁜 영애는 없다"},{"en":"There's No Such Thing as a Bad Lady"},{"fr":"Aucune Lady n’est Mauvaise"},{"th":"ไม่มีหรอกนะ คุณหนูนิสัยเสีย"},{"zh-hk":"世上沒有壞千金"}],"description":{"en":"Raised in the slums of Ebelstein, Derek knows all too well that magic cannot bridge social divides. Through harsh lessons and hard-earned discipline, he rises to become a second-tier mage, scraping by as a mercenary. Life takes a different turn when he is appointed as a magical tutor to Diella Duplain-- the temperamental youngest daughter of a noble house, unable to wield magic despite her lineage. Though Derek is her last resort before exile to a convent, Diella clashes with him from the start. Together, will they be able to prove that there’s no such thing as a “bad” lady?\n\n(Source: Naver WebToon)","fr":"Le jeune Derick, né dans un bidonville d'Evelstein, se révèle être un mage prodige. Devenu mercenaire, il enchaîne les missions et développe ses aptitudes jusqu'à un jour être convié à travailler pour un grand archiduc. Ce dernier lui confie une mission difficile. Derick doit enseigner la magie à sa fille cadette, une demoiselle enfermée dans la propriété annexe de sa famille à cause de son comportement violent.","ko":"귀족 영애라는 족속들은 싸가지가 없거나, 머리에 꽃밭밖에 없다.\n그런 말이 무성하던 시대에도, 그녀들을 가르치는 사람이 있었으니,\n\n평민 ‘데릭’은 마법 재능을 깨닫고 용병으로 활약하던 중,\n어느 날 귀족 영애들의 마법 교사로 초빙된다.\n싸가지 없던 영애들을 ‘사람’으로 만들어주는 일타 강사 '데릭'의 활약에\n쏟아지는 명문 귀족 가문들의 러브콜.\n\n'세상에 나쁜 영애는 없다.', 적어도 데릭 앞에선.\n\n(Source: Naver WebToon)","th":"ว่ากันว่าคุณหนูชนชั้นสูงสามารถแบ่งได้เป็นสองประเภท ไม่หยาบคายไร้มารยาทไปเลย ก็เป็นพวกใสซื่อไร้เดียงสาที่มีแต่ดอกไม้ในหัว ท่ามกลางยุคสมัยที่เต็มไปด้วยคำครหาเช่นนั้น กลับมีชายคนหนึ่งที่ลุกขึ้นมาสั่งสอนพวกเธอ เดอร์ริค สามัญชนผู้ถูกปลุกพลังเวทมนตร์ และไต่เต้าจนมีชื่อเสียงในฐานะทหารรับจ้าง วันหนึ่งเขาได้รับเชิญให้มาเป็นอาจารย์สอนเวทมนตร์ให้เหล่าคุณหนูตระกูลขุนนาง เมื่อเดอร์ริคพิสูจน์ฝีมือจนกลายเป็นอาจารย์ดาวเด่น สามารถเปลี่ยนเหล่าคุณหนูผู้เอาแต่ใจให้กลายเป็น \"คนที่เหมาะสม\" ได้ ตระกูลขุนนางชั้นสูงต่างก็เริ่มต่อคิวเชิญตัวเขาไปสอนลูกสาวของตน \"ไม่มีคุณหนูขุนนางคนไหนนิสัยเสียหรอก\" อย่างน้อย… ก็ไม่ใช่ตอนที่อยู่ตรงหน้าเขา","zh-hk":"「所謂貴族千金，不是沒教養，就是腦袋空空。」 在這種傳言盛行的時代——卻有一個人，專門負責「教導」她們。平民出身的德瑞克，覺醒了魔法天賦後，以傭兵身分活躍。某天，他被邀請成為貴族千金們的魔法教師。 將那些沒教養的千金們，一個個「教成正常人」的王牌講師——德瑞克。他的活躍表現，引來無數名門貴族的爭相邀請。 「這世上沒有壞千金。」至少——在德瑞克面前是如此。"},"isLocked":false,"links":{"al":"206766","ap":"theres-no-such-thing-as-a-bad-lady","mu":"fx9ewqq","mal":"190681","raw":"https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=846779","engtl":"https://www.webtoons.com/-/-/-/list?title_no=9716"},"officialLinks":null,"originalLanguage":"ko","lastVolume":"","lastChapter":"","publicationDemographic":null,"status":"ongoing","year":2026,"contentRating":"safe","tags":[{"id":"0bc90acb-ccc1-44ca-a34a-b9f3a73259d0","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Reincarnation"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"33771934-028e-4cb3-8744-691e866a923e","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Historical"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"391b0423-d847-456f-aff0-8b0cfc03066b","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Action"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"4d32cc48-9f00-4cca-9b5a-a839f0764984","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Comedy"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"87cc87cd-a395-47af-b27a-93258283bbc6","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Adventure"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"a1f53773-c69a-4ce5-8cab-fffcd90b1565","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Magic"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"b9af3a63-f058-46de-a9a0-e0c13906197a","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Drama"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"cdc58593-87dd-415e-bbc0-2ec27bf404cc","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Fantasy"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]}],"state":"published","chapterNumbersResetOnNewVolume":false,"createdAt":"2026-06-24T21:18:54+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-06-25T15:46:27+00:00","version":3,"availableTranslatedLanguages":[],"latestUploadedChapter":null},"relationships":[{"id":"106e37e8-8316-4f07-9b88-1f44abe75c84","type":"author","attributes":{"name":"Shin Heebin (신희빈)","imageUrl":null,"biography":{},"twitter":null,"pixiv":null,"melonBook":null,"fanBox":null,"booth":null,"namicomi":null,"nicoVideo":null,"skeb":null,"fantia":null,"tumblr":null,"youtube":null,"weibo":null,"naver":null,"website":null,"createdAt":"2021-11-25T08:17:20+00:00","updatedAt":"2021-11-25T08:17:20+00:00","version":1}},{"id":"8ca212a8-7f40-4ae3-a047-5dfb6c9bdf80","type":"author","attributes":{"name":"Korita (코리타) ","imageUrl":null,"biography":{},"twitter":null,"pixiv":null,"melonBook":null,"fanBox":null,"booth":null,"namicomi":null,"nicoVideo":null,"skeb":null,"fantia":null,"tumblr":null,"youtube":null,"weibo":null,"naver":null,"website":null,"createdAt":"2023-12-27T13:00:05+00:00","updatedAt":"2024-06-17T15:34:00+00:00","version":3}},{"id":"54a24979-f722-44a8-b13f-ccc161e26b7f","type":"artist"},{"id":"e0e31ab1-6c51-406f-9f63-2f2d820ec729","type":"cover_art","attributes":{"description":"","volume":"1","fileName":"3a0716c4-6bb0-441d-b2ad-e5174e700197.jpg","locale":"ko","createdAt":"2026-06-24T21:18:57+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-06-24T21:18:57+00:00","version":1}},{"id":"65c80a03-595f-48ba-a265-2438804580f0","type":"creator"}]},{"id":"68c47b79-1dd3-45a9-ac20-ca01dacd0c20","type":"manga","attributes":{"title":{"en":"Because I Am a Terminally-Ill Princess With No Tomorrow"},"altTitles":[{"ko":"내일이 없는 시한부 공주라서요"},{"ko-ro":"Naeiri Eomneun Sihanbu Gongjuraseoyo"},{"en":"I'm a Terminally-Ill Princess With No Tomorrow"},{"en":"The Princess Who Has No Tomorrow"},{"ru":"Потому что я смертельно больная принцесса, у которой нет завтрашнего дня"},{"ru":"Принцесса, которой не суждено дожить до завтра"}],"description":{"en":"A \"VIP of the Underworld\" whose specialty is dying young. \n\n\"Ah, I died again...\"\n\nSangra Heeyo, the Heavenly Princess, is the deeply cherished only daughter of the Jade Emperor and the King of the Underworld. The only thing she lacks is a healthy body.\n\nAfter hearing the tragic story of a young mortal princess named Seruha in the Underworld, Heeyo decides to break the rules. Since Seruha has lost the will to live, Heeyo secretly runs away to the human realm to take her place, sneaking past her parents.\n\n\"Wait, why are there so many humans trying to kill a little kid?!\"\n\nShe wakes up in the Empire of Un, married off like property. Not only is the place crawling with enemies trying to kill Seruha, but there are also assassins targeting her new husband, Crown Prince Cheon Gyeol-woo.\n\n\"I can't just stand by and watch these villains bully innocent people!\"","ko":"단명(短命)이 특기인 '삼도천 VIP'\n\"나 또 죽었구나…\"\n옥황상제와 염라대왕의 금지옥엽 외동딸, 천명공주 '상라희요'.\n그녀가 가지지 못한 딱 한 가지는 바로 건강이었다.\n\n삼도천에서 만난 어린 황녀 '세루화'의 기구한 사연을 들은 희요는\n살기를 거부하는 그녀 대신 엄마아빠 몰래 인간계로 가출을 감행하게 되는데…\n\n\"아니, 어린애 목숨을 노리는 인간이 뭐 이리 많아?!\n\n팔려가듯 시집 간 운국에는 루화를 죽이려는 세력뿐 아니라,\n그녀의 남편이자 세자인 '천결우'를 암살하려는 자들로 득실거렸다.\n\n'착한 아이를 괴롭히는 못된 놈들을 가만둘 순 없지!'"},"isLocked":false,"links":{"al":"213239","ap":"because-i-am-a-terminally-ill-princess-with-no-tomorrow","mu":"lsxqk2u","nu":"since-im-a-time-limited-princess-who-has-no-tomorrow","raw":"https://page.kakao.com/content/69276361"},"officialLinks":null,"originalLanguage":"ko","lastVolume":"","lastChapter":"","publicationDemographic":null,"status":"ongoing","year":2026,"contentRating":"safe","tags":[{"id":"3e2b8dae-350e-4ab8-a8ce-016e844b9f0d","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Long Strip"},"description":{},"group":"format","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"423e2eae-a7a2-4a8b-ac03-a8351462d71d"